      "text": "Okay, a few basics will make a big difference. First, clear all the snow off the car, including the roof, so it doesn't slide onto your windscreen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 23.94,
      "end": 29.54,
      "text": "Even the roof. Then pull away gently in second gear if you have a manual, it stops the wheels spinning."
