      "start": 34.29,
      "end": 40.95,
      "text": "Then just be very light on the accelerator. Brake early and softly, and leave about ten times the usual gap to the car in front."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 48.86,
      "end": 55.89,
      "text": "It does, until you need it. Stopping distances on snow are massive. And avoid sudden steering, smooth inputs are everything."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 60.27,
